cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite both the software and the paper."
title: "DF-GWO: parsimonious software defect prediction"
abstract: >-
  Reproduction package for a binary Grey Wolf Optimizer combining correlation-based
  dynamic feature grouping, a logistic-map chaotic control schedule, a Levy-flight
  perturbation and a composite F1/AUC/MCC fitness with an explicit size penalty,
  evaluated on twenty PROMISE, AEEEM and ReLink projects.
